      "message": "I think your assessment is right. I still want to point out this is not limited to isActiveNetworkMetered() ; getActiveNetworkInfo() or getActiveLinkProperties() exhibit the same discrepancy. Fixing this may be troublesome.\nThat being said, because this method is just a boolean and has such a reduced scope, in this particular case I think we can simply not take this change and everyone is actually better for it.\n\nI\u0027ll see about reverting ag/3580901 in pi-dev.",
